the slutty pumpkin, we had a Thanksgiving episode, we had a New Year's episode in the limo, we didn't really do a Christmas episode, I think we just didn't have an idea we were excited enough about.
放荡的南瓜，我们有一个感恩节剧集，我们在豪华轿车里有一个新年剧集，我们并没有真正制作圣诞节剧集，我想我们只是没有一个让我们足够兴奋的想法。

