Like, it's a much longer kind of tremor or like aftershock than I had remembered, but I'm glad to see that because it does feel like, one thing I admire about you and Carter and the writers, like you were always, I think, pausing to go, what is the real thing happening?
就像，这是一种比我记忆中更长的震颤或余震，但我很高兴看到这一点，因为它确实让人感觉，我钦佩你、卡特和编剧们，就像你总是那样，我想，停下来，真正发生的事情是什么？

